        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >core gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player control: Use the keyboard directional keys (↑↓←→) to control the movement of King Zhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Zhou and each of his concubines have a number displayed above their heads (shown in the center of the picture).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time a concubine is successfully captured, King Zhou's number only increases by 1 (the score is calculated based on the number of concubines captured).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concubine logic:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep 6 concubines on the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After catching a concubine, immediately refresh a new concubine, keeping the total number at 6.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement mechanism: All concubines move randomly within the screen, bounce back when they touch the boundary, and periodically change their movement direction randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules for capturing concubines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Zhou can only capture concubines whose numbers are less than or equal to King Zhou's number (friendly concubines).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consorts with numbers greater than the number of King Zhou (enemy concubines, red logic) cannot be caught. Touching them will end the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent color change: After each capture, all concubines update the color of their heads based on the current number of King Zhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level system: For every 10 captured concubines, their movement speed will slightly increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game end and restart:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When King Zhou encounters a concubine whose number is greater than his own, the game ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the game ends, you can choose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press R to restart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Q to exit the game</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >core gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player control: Use the keyboard directional keys (↑↓←→) to control the movement of King Zhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Zhou and each of his concubines have a number displayed above their heads (shown in the center of the picture).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time a concubine is successfully captured, King Zhou's number only increases by 1 (the score is calculated based on the number of concubines captured).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concubine logic:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep 6 concubines on the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After catching a concubine, immediately refresh a new concubine, keeping the total number at 6.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement mechanism: All concubines move randomly within the screen, bounce back when they touch the boundary, and periodically change their movement direction randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules for capturing concubines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Zhou can only capture concubines whose numbers are less than or equal to King Zhou's number (friendly concubines).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consorts with numbers greater than the number of King Zhou (enemy concubines, red logic) cannot be caught. Touching them will end the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent color change: After each capture, all concubines update the color of their heads based on the current number of King Zhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level system: For every 10 captured concubines, their movement speed will slightly increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game end and restart:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When King Zhou encounters a concubine whose number is greater than his own, the game ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the game ends, you can choose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press R to restart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Q to exit the game</p>",
        "short_description": "Use the keyboard directional keys (↑↓←→) to control the movement of King Zhou. Each time a concubine is successfully captured, King Zhou's number will only increase by 1 (the score will be calculated based on the number of the captured concubine)",
